  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZRL after Concession</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZRL efter koncession</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att utveckla och etablera ett robust system f&#xf6;r uppf&#xf6;ljning av koncessionsavtalet f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;rnv&#xe4;gsdriften i Zambia. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultat: 1) kompetent zambisk personal som kan sk&#xf6;ta uppf&#xf6;ljningen; 2) robust uppf&#xf6;ljningssystem p&#xe5; plats; 3) plan f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rmera v&#xe4;rdet p&#xe5; ZRLs kvarvarande tillg&#xe5;ngar framtagen; 3) kometent styrelse f&#xf6;r ZRL; 5) contingency plan framtagen (fallback plan).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to develop and establish roubust concessioning monitoring principles and procedures. Expected results: 1) competents Zambian montoring staff; 2) roubust and well established monitoring system in place; 3) plan for the development of &quot;ongoing ZRL&quot; land holdings presented; 4) strengthened and competent board for ZRL; 5) contingency plan developed.</narrative>
  </description>
